<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · city</p><h1 class="enc-title">Idah</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Idah is a town in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kogi-state">Kogi State</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nigeria">Nigeria</a>, on the east bank of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/niger-river">Niger</a>. It is the capital of the Igala Kingdom and the seat of its ruler, the Attah. Controlling river trade between the north and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/niger-delta">Niger Delta</a>, it was visited by European expeditions and missionaries in the 19th century.</p></div>
